# PhoneInfoga scanner configuration
# Put your real values here and keep this file out of version control.
# See: docs/getting-started/scanners.md

# Numverify / Apilayer key
NUMVERIFY_API_KEY="replace-with-your-numverify-key"

# Google Custom Search API key and search engine ID
GOOGLE_API_KEY="replace-with-your-google-api-key"
GOOGLECSE_CX="replace-with-your-google-custom-search-engine-id"

# Optional: if you are using other scanners or plugins, add their keys here.
# Example:
# SOME_OTHER_API_KEY="your-value"
